# sdist completeness: the wheel ships only resembl/, but the sdist is the
# documented install path for the README example (`resembl import tests/test_data`).
# Without this graft the 689 .asm fixtures are silently absent from the sdist,
# so an sdist install cannot run the example it documents. setuptools already
# includes tests/*.py via package discovery; the data files need an explicit graft.
# docs/ is grafted so the man page and tutorial referenced from the README
# travel with the sdist as well.
graft tests/test_data
graft docs
